## 5. Performance Optimization

### GPU Acceleration
**Best Practices**:
- Animate `transform` and `opacity` only (not `width`, `height`, `position`)
- Use `will-change` CSS property sparingly
- Prefer `translateX/Y` over `left/right`
- Use `scale` instead of `width/height`

```css
/* Good: GPU accelerated */
.element {
  transform: translateX(100px);
  opacity: 0.5;
}

/* Bad: CPU intensive */
.element {
  left: 100px;
  width: 200px;
}
```

### Debouncing & Throttling
**Purpose**: Reduce animation frame calculations
**Library**: `lodash` or `framer-motion` built-in

```tsx
// Throttle scroll events
const throttledScroll = throttle(() => {
  // Animation logic
}, 16); // ~60fps
```

### Lazy Loading Animations
**Purpose**: Don't animate off-screen elements
**Implementation**:
```tsx
<motion.div
  initial={{ opacity: 0 }}
  whileInView={{ opacity: 1 }}
  viewport={{ once: true, margin: "-100px" }}
/>
```

