## 6. Interaction Patterns

### Hover Effects
```tsx
<motion.button
  whileHover={{ scale: 1.05, boxShadow: "0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2)" }}
  whileTap={{ scale: 0.95 }}
/>
```

### Drag Interactions
```tsx
<motion.div
  drag
  dragConstraints={{ left: -100, right: 100, top: -100, bottom: 100 }}
  dragElastic={0.2}
  onDragEnd={(event, info) => console.log(info.velocity)}
/>
```

### Gesture Animations
```tsx
<motion.div
  initial="rest"
  whileHover="hover"
  whileTap="tap"
  variants={{
    rest: { scale: 1 },
    hover: { scale: 1.1 },
    tap: { scale: 0.95 },
  }}
/>
```

