## 7. Advanced Patterns

### Staggered Animations
```tsx
const containerVariants = {
  hidden: { opacity: 0 },
  visible: {
    opacity: 1,
    transition: {
      staggerChildren: 0.1,
      delayChildren: 0.2,
    },
  },
};

const itemVariants = {
  hidden: { opacity: 0, y: 20 },
  visible: { opacity: 1, y: 0 },
};
```

### Parallax Scrolling
```tsx
// Using Framer Motion scroll values
const y = useScroll();
const yRange = useTransform(y, [0, 1000], [0, -100]);

<motion.div style={{ y: yRange }} />
```

### SVG Path Animations
```tsx
<motion.path
  initial={{ pathLength: 0 }}
  animate={{ pathLength: 1 }}
  transition={{ duration: 2 }}
/>
```

### Morphing Shapes
```tsx
<motion.svg>
  <motion.path
    animate={{ d: path1 ? pathA : pathB }}
    transition={{ duration: 0.5 }}
  />
</motion.svg>
```

