## 8. Design System for Motion

### Timing Standards
| Type | Duration | Use Case |
|------|----------|----------|
| Micro | 100-200ms | Hover, focus states |
| Short | 200-500ms | Button clicks, small reveals |
| Medium | 500-1000ms | Section transitions, page changes |
| Long | 1000-2000ms | Hero animations, entrance effects |
| Extended | 2000ms+ | Background loops, ambient motion |

### Easing Recommendations
| Easing | Feel | Use Case |
|--------|------|----------|
| `easeOut` | Snappy, responsive | UI interactions, button clicks |
| `easeInOut` | Smooth, natural | Page transitions, scroll reveals |
| `circInOut` | Very smooth | Premium feel, hero animations |
| `backInOut` | Playful, bouncy | Playful interfaces, game-like UX |
| `anticipate` | Anticipatory | Entrance animations, dramatic reveals |

### Color Motion
```tsx
// Animate color changes smoothly
<motion.div
  animate={{ backgroundColor: ["#ff0000", "#00ff00", "#0000ff"] }}
  transition={{ duration: 3, repeat: Infinity }}
/>
```

