## 10. Common Pitfalls & Solutions

### Pitfall 1: Animating Layout Properties
**Problem**: Animating `width`, `height`, `position` causes jank
**Solution**: Use `transform` instead
```tsx
// ❌ Bad
animate={{ width: 200, height: 200 }}

// ✅ Good
animate={{ scale: 1.2 }}
```

### Pitfall 2: Over-animating
**Problem**: Too many simultaneous animations cause performance issues
**Solution**: Stagger animations, use `once: true` for scroll reveals
```tsx
whileInView={{ opacity: 1 }}
viewport={{ once: true }} // Only animate once
```

### Pitfall 3: Inconsistent Timing
**Problem**: Random durations feel unprofessional
**Solution**: Use consistent timing scale (100ms increments)
```tsx
// ✅ Good: Consistent timing
transition={{ duration: 0.3 }} // 300ms
transition={{ duration: 0.6 }} // 600ms
transition={{ duration: 1.2 }} // 1200ms
```

### Pitfall 4: Ignoring Accessibility
**Problem**: Animations can cause motion sickness for some users
**Solution**: Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
```tsx
const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches;
const duration = prefersReducedMotion ? 0 : 0.8;
```

